---
import { MENSAGENS, whatsappUrl } from '../data/contato';

const convenios = [
  "ArcelorMittal",
  "Bradesco Saúde",
  "Capesaúde",
  "Cassi",
  "Cesan",
  "GEAP Saúde",
  "Mediservice",
  "PASA",
  "Petrobras",
  "Porto de Vitória",
  "Postal Saúde",
  "Saúde Caixa",
  "SulAmérica Saúde",
  "Unimed",
  "Vale",
];

const formatter = new Intl.ListFormat("pt-BR", {
  style: "long",
  type: "conjunction",
});
const fraseConvenios = formatter.format(convenios);
---

<section class="alt" id="convenios" aria-labelledby="convenios-titulo">
  <div class="wrap convenios-container">
    <div class="stack convenios-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Convênios</p>
      <h2 id="convenios-titulo">Convênios atendidos em Vitória, Serra e Vila Velha</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        O Dr. Bernardo Barroso, ortopedista especialista em joelho, atende pelos convênios {fraseConvenios}, além de consultas particulares.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="convenios-grid" role="list">
      {
        convenios.map((nome) => (
          <li class="convenio-card">
            <span class="convenio-initial" aria-hidden="true">
              {nome.charAt(0)}
            </span>
            <span class="convenio-nome">{nome}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <div class="convenios-footer">
      <p class="convenios-aviso">
        A cobertura pode variar conforme o plano, a unidade e o procedimento. Antes do agendamento, a secretaria confirma a cobertura e orienta sobre a autorização de cirurgias e procedimentos.
      </p>
      <a
        href={whatsappUrl(MENSAGENS.convenios)}
        class="btn btn-ghost"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        data-cta="whatsapp-convenios"
      >
        Confirmar meu convênio no WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .convenios-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  }

  .convenios-header {
    gap: 12px;
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .convenios-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 200px), 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .convenio-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--r);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(79, 209, 197, 0.05), rgba(6, 11, 16, 0.4) 75%);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .convenio-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--brand);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(79, 209, 197, 0.08);
  }

  .convenio-initial {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(79, 209, 197, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-line);
    color: var(--brand);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .convenio-nome {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .convenios-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 22px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .convenios-aviso {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-4);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 62ch;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .convenio-card {
      transition: none;
    }
    .convenio-card:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
